take full advantage of that 20% government match and then invest in a globally diversified

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:14.080
equity ETF ladder that gradually de-risks over time. You can build this yourself with a simple

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:19.660
glide path, higher equity allocations when the child is young, then slowly shifting into balanced

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:25.720
and fixed income ETFs as they approach 18. There are also several advanced coordination tactics

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:30.220
worth understanding. One of my favorites is the TFSA over-contribution refund hack.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:34.100
If you expect a large bonus inheritance or windfall later in the year,

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:40.580
you can deliberately over-contribute to your TFSA now and immediately file form RC-432 to elect

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:45.960
to withdraw the excess amount without incurring the usual 1% per month penalty. This resets your

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:50.680
