00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:56.400
you two years of room in a single calendar year when timed correctly. Another powerful strategy

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:04.520
for investors aged 55 to 65 is the RRSP meltdown. The idea is to gradually convert portions of your

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:11.080
RRSP to a RIF while you are temporarily in a lower tax bracket, perhaps during a sabbatical,

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:16.840
