00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:22.760
Done systematically, this can significantly reduce the tax hit you'll eventually face at age 71

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:28.640
when RIF minimum withdrawals begin. Family unit optimization can also add meaningful value.

