00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:56.940
dollars by retirement with zero additional market risk. Of course, there are several common

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:03.800
2026 pitfalls you need to avoid. Never put US dividend aristocrats inside a TFSA. You lose the

00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:08.740
